"""CDR 2026 design review: the Review Item Discrepancies (RIDs) and their dispositions.

Each RID: (id, severity, title, disposition, evidence). Severity 1 = mission or safety
critical, 2 = must close before fabrication, 3 = should fix.

Dispositions:
  CA  closed by analysis
  CD  closed by design change (documents or code)
  CH  closed by a chair decision (baseline, requirements or cross-discipline change)
  VI  verification item: needs hardware; a defined test with a pass criterion and a date
  DP  programmatic decision point: needs an outside party (contract, agreement, filing);
      the action, owner and due date are set in the schedule
  IMP implementation (flight software or simulation) assigned in the review; its status
      is set in `status` below after round 2

`gen_rid_log.py` renders the log for docs/reviews/CDR/CDR_2026_DESIGN_REVIEW.md.
"""

